# Everything here is run on Windows after being downloaded as a ZIP, and a
# ZIP straight off GitHub carries whatever line endings the repository
# stores. cmd.exe is not reliably happy with LF-only .bat files, so pin the
# two files people actually execute to CRLF and stop guessing.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Everything else is read, not run.
*.md   text eol=lf
*.lua  text eol=lf
*.info text eol=lf
*.png  binary
